    <h1>Privacy Policy — Marketplace. Managed.</h1>
    <p class="fine">Last updated: October 2026.</p>
    <p>Marketplace. Managed., operated by WEP Ventures LLC ("we," "us"), provides managed Facebook Marketplace selling services. This policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights.</p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Item information you provide:</strong> photos, descriptions, condition, model numbers, and what's included with your item.</li>
      <li><strong>Contact details:</strong> your name and the contact information you share during intake.</li>
      <li><strong>Messenger information:</strong> when you chat with us on Facebook Messenger, we receive your Messenger profile name and ID and your conversation history so we can respond. If you opt in to price notifications, we also store the one-time notification permission Meta provides so we can message you once outside the standard messaging window.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment information:</strong> the $5 listing fee is processed by Stripe. We do not see or store your card number.</li>
      <li><strong>Transaction records:</strong> listing details, offers, and sale outcomes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To prepare your price quote and publish your Marketplace listing.</li>
      <li>To communicate with buyers on your behalf and coordinate pickup.</li>
      <li>To process the listing fee and maintain transaction records.</li>
      <li>To improve our pricing estimates.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What becomes public</h2>
    <p>When your listing goes live, the item photos, description, and price you approved become visible on Facebook Marketplace. Your personal contact details are never published.</p>

    <h2>Storage and sharing</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Data is stored with our infrastructure providers (currently Supabase for records and approved listing photos, Stripe for payments, Meta for messaging).</li>
      <li>Photos you send us in Messenger may be held temporarily in private storage so we can review them. They are deleted automatically within 7 days unless you approve them for your listing, and we never use them for any other purpose. Only photos you approve are copied to our public listing storage.</li>
      <li>Messages you send in Messenger remain subject to Meta's retention and privacy practices. We cannot delete them from Meta.</li>
      <li>We do not sell your personal data.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>We keep transaction records for as long as needed for accounting and legal obligations. Intake data for items that never list is deleted within 90 days. You may request earlier deletion at any time (see below).</p>

    <h2 id="data-deletion">Your rights and data deletion</h2>
    <p>You may request a copy of your data or ask us to delete it by emailing <a href="mailto:info@wepventures.com?subject=Data%20request">info@wepventures.com</a> with the subject "Data request." To protect you, we will confirm the request in your Messenger conversation with us before acting on it. We will respond within 30 days. Deleting your data before a sale completes will cancel the listing. This covers the data we hold; it does not remove messages stored by Meta.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We will post any changes to this policy on this page.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href="mailto:info@wepventures.com">info@wepventures.com</a>.</p>
